    "Provided-buffer unregister/reuse retains the in-flight generation rather than advancing the replacement group.",
    "Unix SCM_RIGHTS/ring registrations share one ownership graph; both admission orders and concurrent reciprocal registration retire without a leaked strong cycle.",
